  "solution": "Given equation: (35 ÷ 7 × 50) ÷ 11 × 1 + 3 = 8.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) + and −\n\nGiven: (35 ÷ 7 × 50) ÷ 11 × 1 + 3 = 8\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ (__**35 ÷ 7**__ × 50) ÷ 11 × 1 - 3 = 8\n\n⇒ (**__5 __**__**× 50**__) ÷ 11 × 1 - 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __**250**____** ÷ 11 × 1**__ - 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __**22.73 - 3**__ = 8\n\n⇒ -19.73 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ÷ and +\n\nGiven: (35 ÷ 7 × 50) ÷ 11 × 1 + 3 = 8\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ (35 + __**7 × 50**__) + 11 × 1 ÷ 3 = 8\n\n⇒ (__**35 + 350**__) + 11 × 1 ÷ 3 = 8\n\n⇒ 385 + __**11 × 1 ÷ 3 **__= 8\n\n⇒ __**385 + 3.67**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 388.67 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\nGiven: (35 ÷ 7 × 50) ÷ 11 × 1 + 3 = 8\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ (__**35 × 7 ÷ 50**__) × 11 ÷ 1 + 3 = 8\n\n⇒ 4.9 × __**11 **____**÷**____** 1**__ + 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __**4.9 ×**____** **11__ + 3 = 8\n\n⇒ **__53.9 + 3__** = 8\n\n⇒ 56.9 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) **+ and ×**\n\nGiven: (35 ÷ 7 × 50) ÷ 11 × 1 + 3 = 8\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ (__**35 ÷ 7**__ + 50) ÷ 11 + 1 × 3 = 8\n\n⇒ (__**5 + 50**__) ÷ 11 + 1 × 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __**55 ÷ 11**__ + 1 × 3 = 8\n\n⇒ 5 + __**1 × 3**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**5 + 3**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 8 = 8\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
